RipperHunt_Title { The Ripper of the Woods }

RipperHunt_Start { A big ripper prowls the woods near the tavern. The hunter wants it dead. }

RipperHunt_Killed { The ripper is dead. I should tell the hunter. }

RipperHunt_Done { The hunter paid me for the ripper. }

Apples_Title { Apples for the Stew }

Apples_Start { Olaf needs three apples for his stew. }

Apples_Done { I brought Olaf the apples. }

Hunter_Name { Hunter }

Hunter_Offer { A ripper hunts in the woods south of here. Kill it and I will pay you. }

Hunter_Waiting { The ripper is still out there. }

Hunter_Reward { You killed the ripper! Here is your pay. }

Hunter_AlreadyDone { The ripper south of here? You already killed it? Then you have earned this. }

Hunter_Thanks { Thanks again for the ripper. }

Player_Accept { I will do it. }

Player_Decline { Not now. }

Player_AskHelp { Do you need help with anything? }

Npc_WantsApples { My stew needs apples. Bring me three and I will make it worth your while. }

Npc_NoApplesYet { Three apples, that is all I ask. }

Npc_ApplesThanks { Perfect, the stew is saved! }

Scout_Name { Scout }

Scout_Offer { Someone harvests the sacred grove. Look at the shrine south of here and take what they left behind. }

Scout_Waiting { Have you been to the shrine yet? }

Scout_Reward { So it is true. Take this for your trouble. }

Scout_AlreadyDone { You already found their supplies at the shrine? Then you are one step ahead of me. }

Scout_Thanks { The grove owes you. }

Tracks_Title { Tracks in the Ash }

Tracks_Start { A scout asked me to look at the shrine south of the tavern. }

Tracks_Shrine { I found the damaged shrine. }

Tracks_Supplies { I took the harvesters' supplies. }

Tracks_Done { The scout knows now who harvests the grove. }

showcase_spezi_name { Spezi }

showcase_spezi_description { Cola and orange lemonade. Heals 30 health over ten seconds. }

showcase_letter_name { A Hunter's Note }

showcase_letter_description { A folded note, smelling of smoke. }

showcase_letter_text { Traveller, the ripper in the woods took two of my sheep. Whoever brings me its hide gets a fair reward. - The Hunter }

showcase_swift_missile_name { Swift Missile }

showcase_swift_missile_description { A magic missile twice as fast and twice as strong, flying a third longer. }

showcase_recipe_swift_missile_name { Recipe: Swift Missile }

showcase_recipe_swift_missile_description { Teaches Swift Missile. Needs a runestone. }

showcase_ripper_form_name { Ripper Form }

showcase_ripper_form_description { Become a ripper for half a minute. }
